      "**8.** 360°",
      "",
      "#### Core practice",
      "",
      "**1.** (a) 72° (corresponding angles are equal) (b) 72° (alternate angles are equal) (c) 108° (co-interior angles add to 180°)",
      "",
      "**2.** 65°",
      "",
      "**3.** 12x = 180, so x = 15; the angles are 45°, 60° and 75°.",
      "",
      "**4.** 110 − 45 = 65°",
      "",
      "**5.** (a) 540° (b) 1,080° (c) 1,800°",
